  "description": "Library API for WACS.Transpiler — programmatic ahead-of-time WebAssembly-to-.NET IL transpilation, plus seamless loading of saved transpiled assemblies. v0.5 adds the AotLinked emission target (skips the codec wrapper for ~22% binary-size reduction; covers memory / data / globals / tables / element segments) and a stable AssemblyName option for static-reference / NativeAOT-linked workflows. The transpiler now emits `[assembly: WacsTranspiledImports]` + `[assembly: WacsImportNames]` so the new WACS.HostBindings.SourceGen Roslyn generator can wire imports straight to `[WacsImport]`-annotated host statics — no reflection, no DispatchProxy. Together these enable the one-shot `wacs aot` CLI.",
